# Build context for publisher/Dockerfile (spec §8.4 phase 5).
#
# node_modules is excluded so the image's dependency tree always comes from
# `npm ci` against the committed lockfile rather than from whatever the
# builder happened to have installed — a runner's tree can contain
# platform-specific binaries and, on a local build, uncommitted changes.

node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.github
apps/web/dist
functions/.env.*
*.log
